  "notes": "Screener result; clinical evaluation required. Item 9 is a safety item: any value above 0 shows the safety-resource screen to that user only, is never surfaced to the partner, and is excluded from every couple-level computation. Cutoffs 5/10/15/20 per Kroenke, Spitzer & Williams 2001. Text and anchors verified against the official form (source_url).",
